---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Memberships" description="Membership applications at American Legion Country Club.">
  <PageHero title="Memberships" subtitle="2027 membership information will be posted when it is finalized." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Coming for the 2027 season</span>
      <h2>Membership Information</h2>
      <p>The 2027 membership categories, prices, and application will be
      posted here when they are finalized. Contact the club office if you
      would like to discuss membership in the meantime.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--red" href="tel:18145424343">Call (814) 542-4343</a>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem;">2026 Reference Materials</h2>
      <p>The previous season's application remains available for reference
      only. Its categories and prices should not be treated as the 2027 offer.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--red" href="/downloads/2026-alcc-membership-application.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        View the 2026 Membership Application (PDF)
      </a>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem;">American Legion Memorial Home Association Membership</h2>
      <p>The 2026 golf application required membership with American Legion
      Post #107, with exceptions described in the application. The prior
      Legion Home Association form remains available below for reference
      while 2027 materials are being prepared.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--navy" href="/downloads/2026-legion-membership-application.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Download the Legion Membership Application (PDF)
      </a>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem;"><em>Questions about membership
      categories or pricing? </em><a href="/contact">Contact the club</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
